What?!

00:15:44.611 --> 00:15:49.783
Miss Roko, you seem mature,
but you're actually quite the baby.

00:15:50.868 --> 00:15:53.996
I can't say either of you have the seniority...

00:15:53.996 --> 00:15:56.164
But let's see...

00:15:56.164 --> 00:15:59.001
You're both the type I want to
keep in a cage like a pet!

00:15:59.001 --> 00:16:00.127
Roko...

00:16:00.127 --> 00:16:01.461
Nua...

00:16:01.461 --> 00:16:03.839
I'm not following this conversation!

00:16:03.839 --> 00:16:06.425
But... I think I get it a little...

00:16:06.425 --> 00:16:10.012
In any case, I think you're both pretty similar.

00:16:10.012 --> 00:16:14.183
Hey, Rua! What do you mean
I'm similar to this one?!

00:16:14.183 --> 00:16:15.767
What?! "This one"?!

00:16:15.767 --> 00:16:18.562
I'm 6 cm taller than her!

00:16:18.562 --> 00:16:20.689
Round it up and I'm even taller!

00:16:20.689 --> 00:16:26.528
What? But when you were little,
you would imitate Miss Roko all the time.

00:16:26.528 --> 00:16:27.529
What?!

00:16:27.529 --> 00:16:30.199
Aren't you actually happy about this?

00:16:30.199 --> 00:16:31.116
No...

00:16:31.116 --> 00:16:34.745
You always wanted her autograph, remember?

00:16:34.745 --> 00:16:39.374
Then why don't I bring that Broko CD
you still treasure so much?

00:16:42.002 --> 00:16:43.795
Just stop...

00:16:45.464 --> 00:16:47.341
Okay, calm down.

00:16:47.341 --> 00:16:49.927
You can get my autograph anytime.

00:16:49.927 --> 00:16:51.011
What are you looking at?!

00:16:51.011 --> 00:16:51.845
What?

00:16:51.845 --> 00:16:56.183
Don't tell me you believe
that old story is still true!

00:16:56.183 --> 00:16:58.018
We all grow out of things!

00:16:58.018 --> 00:17:01.730
I've graduated from that
kiddy stuff a long time ago!

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:05.234
Look, this is a cute video of Nua.

00:17:05.234 --> 00:17:08.612
♬ Brokko, Brokko, Broccoli. ♬

00:17:08.612 --> 00:17:12.074
♬ Brokko, Brokko, Broccoli... ♬

00:17:12.074 --> 00:17:13.700
That's CG!

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:16.411
Hey! Stop peeping on me!

00:17:16.411 --> 00:17:18.789
Stop looking at me naked!

00:17:18.789 --> 00:17:20.874
Nua is an A-cup, by the way.

00:17:20.874 --> 00:17:22.292
Stop!

00:17:22.292 --> 00:17:25.504
Anyway, we're a lot more popular than you all!

00:17:25.504 --> 00:17:27.339
And I'm not your fan at all!

00:17:27.339 --> 00:17:28.674
Well...

00:17:28.674 --> 00:17:31.677
You've been saying that you're more popular...

00:17:31.677 --> 00:17:32.803
What?!

00:17:32.803 --> 00:17:36.431
We didn't even know we went to the same school.

00:17:37.766 --> 00:17:40.519
So maybe you all aren't all that after all.

00:17:41.436 --> 00:17:43.939
D-Don't get all mixed up.

00:17:44.815 --> 00:17:49.528
That's because I wear glasses
to disguise myself at school.

00:17:49.528 --> 00:17:51.655
You only remembered to wear them just now.

00:17:53.490 --> 00:17:56.285
But... glasses...?

00:17:57.536 --> 00:17:59.746
I'm not sure what to tell her...

00:17:59.746 --> 00:18:01.415
"100%
Not fooling anyone!"

00:18:01.415 --> 00:18:03.542
"100%
Not fooling anyone!"
Maybe she really is just dumb...

00:18:04.543 --> 00:18:07.379
I know, right?! She really is so dumb!

00:18:07.379 --> 00:18:09.298
But she's so cute!

00:18:09.298 --> 00:18:11.633
This girl must be a sadist!

00:18:11.633 --> 00:18:13.010
Oh no!

00:18:13.010 --> 00:18:15.304
You don't have to compliment me
that much, you know?

00:18:15.304 --> 00:18:17.431
What?! C-Compliment?!

00:18:17.431 --> 00:18:18.849
You're embarrassing me.

00:18:18.849 --> 00:18:21.476
Don't read my thoughts like that!

00:18:21.476 --> 00:18:24.688
You're just going to put up with her teasing?

00:18:24.688 --> 00:18:26.190
Are you an extreme masochist?

00:18:26.190 --> 00:18:28.442
What?! No, that's...

00:18:30.694 --> 00:18:32.571
...not true at all...

00:18:32.571 --> 00:18:34.364
What was that pause about?

00:18:34.364 --> 00:18:36.450
O-Oh no, look at the time!

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:37.743
We'll be late for work!

00:18:37.743 --> 00:18:38.994
She dodged the question.

00:18:38.994 --> 00:18:40.746
Yup, that's exactly what she did.

00:18:40.746 --> 00:18:44.541
Unlike Fruit Tart, we're busy with work!

00:18:44.541 --> 00:18:47.961
We don't have time to talk all day like this.

00:18:49.129 --> 00:18:52.341
When we see each other again
as Cream Anmitsu, we're rivals!

00:18:53.467 --> 00:18:55.260
Later!

00:18:55.260 --> 00:18:56.803
Oh! And...

00:18:56.803 --> 00:18:58.639
Huh?

00:18:58.639 --> 00:19:01.141
I'll have the CD next time...

00:19:01.141 --> 00:19:04.478
So you can sign it if you want...

00:19:04.478 --> 00:19:06.688
Be grateful for it!

00:19:06.688 --> 00:19:08.815
Never mind! That was a lie!

00:19:08.815 --> 00:19:10.734
Okay, see you later!

00:19:10.734 --> 00:19:12.611
Okay, okay.

00:19:12.611 --> 00:19:15.614
They were so weird.

00:19:15.614 --> 00:19:18.700
But they weren't as bad as I thought.

00:19:19.660 --> 00:19:21.745
They are weird, though.

00:19:21.745 --> 00:19:23.747
Plus, they're perverts, too.

00:19:23.747 --> 00:19:28.544
And what did she mean by
"we're rivals the next time we meet"?

00:19:28.544 --> 00:19:31.547
We're still newcomers starting out.

00:19:31.547 --> 00:19:32.881
Right, Nina?

00:19:34.007 --> 00:19:35.551
Here, come over here.

00:19:36.718 --> 00:19:39.137
Why are you undressing?

00:19:39.137 --> 00:19:41.098
Come here.

00:19:41.098 --> 00:19:43.100
Nina's a pervert, too.

00:19:55.904 --> 00:19:56.780
What?!

00:19:56.780 --> 00:19:59.116
You saw my big sister at school?!

00:19:59.116 --> 00:20:03.370
Even I haven't seen her in a school setting!

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:05.289
As expected from a sibling of yours,

00:20:05.289 --> 00:20:06.915
she was very cute!

00:20:06.915 --> 00:20:09.293
Hey, Rua!

00:20:09.293 --> 00:20:11.670
You didn't tease her, did you?

00:20:11.670 --> 00:20:15.591
The only one allowed to do that is me...

00:20:15.591 --> 00:20:17.843
Wow! Now that's a sister complex!

00:20:19.428 --> 00:20:21.096
But not to worry!

00:20:21.096 --> 00:20:23.765
I was just teasing Nua as usual.

00:20:23.765 --> 00:20:25.350
As usual?

00:20:25.350 --> 00:20:26.768
Good. Then that's fine.

00:20:26.768 --> 00:20:28.353
That's fine?!

00:20:28.353 --> 00:20:29.479
Hey, wait a minute!

00:20:29.479 --> 00:20:32.482
Oh, let it go.

00:20:32.482 --> 00:20:36.111
Darn it... I won't let her get away with this...

00:20:37.196 --> 00:20:40.365
I've gotta take my revenge once in a while.

00:20:40.365 --> 00:20:43.243
I'll secretly take a picture
of her in her underwear...

00:20:45.787 --> 00:20:46.914
Huh?

00:20:46.914 --> 00:20:48.665
It's out of focus...

00:20:50.959 --> 00:20:52.419
Huh?

00:20:52.419 --> 00:20:53.795
Did I press the wrong button?

00:20:53.795 --> 00:20:55.339
Huh? What?

00:20:56.882 --> 00:20:58.008
Well...

00:20:58.008 --> 00:21:00.636
I can understand why she'd want to tease her.

00:22:44.531 --> 00:22:45.866
President.

00:22:45.866 --> 00:22:49.161
For their CD release event, Fruit Tart will be

00:22:49.161 --> 00:22:51.997
performing a concert in Omiya next week.

00:22:51.997 --> 00:22:54.208
Oh...

00:22:54.208 --> 00:22:57.085
Then the pieces are coming together...

00:22:59.630 --> 00:23:02.549
For our vision.

00:23:02.549 --> 00:23:04.384
Fruit Tart...

00:23:05.427 --> 00:23:06.762
No...

00:23:06.762 --> 00:23:10.516
All idols must give it their all.

00:23:25.280 --> 00:23:30.160
"Preview"
All right! Next on <i>Dropout Idol Fruit Tart</i>!

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:34.039
This is Chiko. Gosh, only I'm allowed
to tease my big sister!

00:23:34.039 --> 00:23:36.542
Nua and Rua, do they really get that?

00:23:36.542 --> 00:23:40.087
All right, the next episode is about
Fruit Tart's concert in Omiya.

00:23:40.087 --> 00:23:41.713
I'll be there, too, of course!

00:23:41.713 --> 00:23:43.298
But I'm not telling my big sister.

00:23:43.298 --> 00:23:45.425
"Diuretic Effect!"
<i>Dropout Idol Fruit Tart</i>!

00:23:45.425 --> 00:23:47.928
"Diuretic Effect!"
Episode 9: Diuretic Effect!

00:23:47.928 --> 00:23:50.102
"Diuretic Effect!"
You better watch it!
